            "kira_final": "Everything is set up and verified end-to-end:\n\n- **Git server**: bare repo at `/git/project`, owned by user `git`, SSH access with password auth (`password` for user git), host key in known_hosts.\n- **post-receive hook**: deploys `main` → `/var/www/main` and `dev` → `/var/www/dev` on each push (instant, well under 3s).\n- **Nginx**: HTTPS on port 8443 with a self-signed certificate (`/etc/nginx/ssl/`), serving `/` from main's deploy dir and `/dev/` from dev's deploy dir.\n- **Verified**: cloned via `sshpass -p password git clone git@localhost:/git/project`, pushed `main` (index.html = \"main branch content\") and `dev` (\"dev branch content\"); both `https://localhost:8443/index.html` and `https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html` returned the correct content.",
